# 49. Recommended Security Best Practices

| Recommendation        | Reason              |
| --------------------- | ------------------- |
| Use `policy drop`     | Secure by default   |
| Allow SSH before drop | Prevent lockout     |
| Allow ICMPv6          | IPv6 requires it    |
| Use sets              | Better performance  |
| Backup before changes | Recovery            |
| Use rate limiting     | Prevent brute force |
| Use logging           | Debug attacks       |
| Test remotely         | Avoid downtime      |

